  "details": "This one isn't anything NEEDED or is useful for many things other than taking good pictures\nhowever it would be amazing if it were to be added into vrchat \nhow the mod worked is in the options menu of the action wheel, there was a tab with toggles to let you make a (local only) statue clone of your avatar that'd stay there until you removed it, even if you switch avatar it'd stay, there were even toggles to create a clone that's locked under a looping animation of whatever movement you were doing when you pushed the button \nallowing you to create moving clones of your avatar\nthis was amazing for taking pictures with multiple characters without needing anyone else for assistance \neven if its not a priority, if this were to be added in I would be ecstatic",
